### ============================================
### Payment Service - API Tests
### ============================================

### 1. Razorpay Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1001,
  "provider": "RAZORPAY",
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "currency": "INR"
}


### 2. Stripe Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1002,
  "provider": "STRIPE",
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "currency": "INR"
}


### 3. PayPal Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1003,
  "provider": "PAYPAL",
  "amount": 3500.00,
  "currency": "USD"
