### 4. Invalid Payment Provider
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1004,
  "provider": "INVALID_PROVIDER",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "INR"
}
